---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "NONE" as NONE
  state "QUEUED" as QUEUED
  state "GENERATING" as GENERATING
  state "READY" as READY
  state "FAILED" as FAILED

  [*] --> NONE : Scene / character created
  NONE --> QUEUED : Draw requested [credit held, job enqueued]
  NONE --> QUEUED : Scene waits for character portrait
  QUEUED --> NONE : Out of credit while waiting
  QUEUED --> GENERATING : AI worker starts
  QUEUED --> FAILED : Enqueue failed [credit released]
  GENERATING --> READY : Image uploaded [credit consumed]
  GENERATING --> FAILED : Blocked by filter / AI error [credit released]
  FAILED --> QUEUED : Parent redraws
  READY --> QUEUED : Redraw scene / regenerate portrait
  READY --> [*]
